Id: ali008f
Severity: FAIL
Category: services
Check: check_aliases
Fix: chmod go-w the included file.
References: aliases(5)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The indicated alias includes a file which has group write permission,
world write permission or both.  This allows others to add or modify
entries in the file, possibly gaining unauthorized privileges.

It is a FAIL because anyone on the system can write it and the file
named is executable.

Until 3.4.0 this was reported as ali008, without the letter for its level.
